{"kind":"answer","payload":{"answer_markdown":"从漯河船闸到漯河港，本次预测采用解析后端，基于具名研究仿真轨迹推算能耗，未做航速优化。\n\n预测结果如下：\n- 航段用时：354.442 s\n- 航行距离：0.689 km\n- 甲组电池能耗：2.46667 kWh\n- 乙组电池能耗：1.85592 kWh\n\n这些数值来自研究仿真，采用解析后端计算；该仿真属于具名研究，真实 LSTM 后端仅覆盖短轨迹，因此未参与本次预测。","answer_status":"accepted","errors":[],"metrics":{"bus_energy_kwh":{"field_path":"summary.bus_energy_kwh","source_ref":"2e9ec7a770391e2a02d173faa795114b9db3686875b4be5741120df1f3268d83","unit":"kWh","value":2.4666678888630895},"distance_km":{"field_path":"summary.distance_km","source_ref":"2e9ec7a770391e2a02d173faa795114b9db3686875b4be5741120df1f3268d83","unit":"km","value":0.689},"duration_s":{"field_path":"summary.duration_s","source_ref":"2e9ec7a770391e2a02d173faa795114b9db3686875b4be5741120df1f3268d83","unit":"s","value":354.4420634920635},"motor_energy_kwh":{"field_path":"summary.motor_energy_kwh","source_ref":"2e9ec7a770391e2a02d173faa795114b9db3686875b4be5741120df1f3268d83","unit":"kWh","value":1.8559240104166637}},"outcome_code":"prediction_completed","sources":[]},"schema_version":"agent-artifact/1","task_id":"d6635781-b110-48fc-aefe-8aaa5909806d"}